@startuml
' Discivium proposed assignment and submission states

title Discivium - Assignment and Submission States
skinparam shadowing false

state "Assignment lifecycle" as AssignmentLifecycle {
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Published : lecturer publishes
  Published --> Closed : assignment is closed
  Draft --> [*] : discarded before publication
  Closed --> [*]
}

state "Submission lifecycle" as SubmissionLifecycle {
  [*] --> Submitted : valid file accepted
  Submitted --> Reviewed : lecturer records feedback
  Reviewed --> [*]
}

note right of AssignmentLifecycle
  Unpublished assignments cannot be
  viewed by students or receive files.
  The team must decide whether a
  published assignment can be unpublished.
end note

note right of SubmissionLifecycle
  The first release models one file
  per submission. Late submissions
  and resubmissions remain policy
  decisions before implementation.
end note
@enduml
